@GetResearch_history_api_research_history_get_cursor = str


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/research/history?limit={{GetResearch_history_api_research_history_get_limit}}&cursor={{GetResearch_history_api_research_history_get_cursor}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{internalToken}}


##############################################
### Request: GET /api/research/{research_id}
### Summary: Get Research
##############################################

